{"availability":"available","full":"Ilyomix/lift","name":"lift","description":"Research-based hypertrophy program — PWA for the gym or home, in English and French (guided sessions, block calendar, rest timer, progress)","category":"Productivity","language":"TypeScript","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-26T11:29:11Z","updated":"2026-10-08T23:29:35Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ilyomix.github.io/lift/","topics":[],"demo":"https://ilyomix.github.io/lift/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:42:54.714Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T23:42:54.714Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T23:42:54.714Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T23:42:54.714Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A research-based hypertrophy program, as a web app you install on your phone."],"features":["Onboarding: language; gym or home training (home equipment: dumbbells, bench, pull-up bar, bands; body weight is always available); training days; body (sex, age, height, weight, optional waist); then either a look, up…","Program: an Upper / Lower / Push / Pull / Legs rotation that runs continuously over your training days (five a week is the program's pace). With four or three days, each session takes more sets so that the week keeps…","Guided sessions: the day's prescription for each exercise (sets, rep range, RIR (reps in reserve), rest, load), your last performance, clean reps, failure / technique / pain flags, supersets and exercise swaps. Machine…","Automatic loads: double progression after each session. When every set reaches the top of the range, the load goes one step above the load really lifted; when every set falls under it, the load goes down. A set pushed…","Rest timer: seven-segment dial, sound and vibration, screen kept awake, and a push notification that arrives even with the phone locked."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Ilyomix/lift/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"55e7ff0d4a3bb8ebc15ec8ad211b